  <item>
    <title>006|「哪吒2」就是部口号电影？今年春节档我们有话要说</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a9c5ead74435e4a341c134</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a9c5ead74435e4a341c134</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Feb 2025 10:45:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎大家收听「電影夜校」第六期内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于今年春节档的奇迹，我们有些“暴论“，当然，我们并不否认《哪吒2》的神奇力量，也算是为这几年下滑的春节档注入了新鲜力量。</span></p><span></span><p><span>是好是坏？我们先聊聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>顺便也点评了一下今年其他春节档的电影，《封神2》《唐探1900》《射雕英雄传》。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 哪吒的无效“反抗”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 《封神》别的不行，音乐不错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">01:03:00</a> “你去了一次中原，就知道什么是爱 ”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3946">01:05:46</a> 《唐探1900》的壳子，就是爱国</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日夜校学员：小林 / Ziggy / 南瓜 /荒荒</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日值班：小林</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期谈话所提及电影：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《哪吒2》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《封神2》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《唐探1900》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《射雕英雄传》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《指环王》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《狄仁杰之四大天王》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《黄飞鸿》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《断刀客》</span></p>]]></description>
