    <guid isPermaLink="false">6794945bd74435e4a3ad49ba</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jan 2025 07:45:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎大家收听「電影夜校」第五期内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>前段时间因为《小小的我》里面的“男凝”话题又被顶上舆论风波。</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影里易烊千玺所饰演的刘春和还有一句台词：我也是正常的成年男性。更是将五慢症患者的“欲望”袒露在观众的面前。</span></p><span></span><p><span>是在故意引发观影不适，还是在消费苦难？</span></p><span></span><p><span>好了，下面就是我们都聊了什么：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a>真的在男凝吗？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="917">15:17</a>是我们太保守吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">37:20</a>电影拍的好不好，才是最关键的问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日夜校学员：小林 / Ziggy / 南瓜 / 芝芝 / 吸管 / Belay</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日值班：小林</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期谈话所提及电影：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《温柔壳》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《绿洲》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《摇太阳》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小小的愿望》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《树先生》</span></p>]]></description>
