  <item>
    <title>002|老登电影vs小妞电影，到底谁是高尚的，谁是粗俗的？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67516410a314b553c65b5066</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67516410a314b553c65b5066</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Dec 2024 08:42:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlPLtKbCmbKRhm4Nx5SRrbiVHwx9.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>最近“老登电影”与“小妞电影”吵的实在火热，这个话题在编辑部里也吵得热热闹闹。</span></p><span></span><p><span>实在按捺不住，我们今天就集结了编辑部里的男同事女同事们一起聊聊——“老登电影”“小妞电影”，如何去定义老登电影？老登电影是否都是具有劣根性的“原罪”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在意识到“老登”电影后，那剩下的“非登”是否会开创一个新的电影创作习惯，或是观众的观影习惯呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>重要的时间节点：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> “老登电影”的定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> 老登电影里的恐弱，与伪“阳刚”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a> 费里尼电影里的“泼妇、荡妇、圣母”三位一体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1609">26:49</a> 我们没有否认老登电影的好，但，“老登”骂小妞电影，却是劈头盖脸的骂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> “凭什么你们的东西就要比我们深刻？！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2296">38:16</a> 朴赞郁的女性电影，其实一点也”不女性“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3094">51:34</a> “水晶湖扫黄大队长 ”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4405">73:25</a> 这是一个时间线的问题，女性掌握生产资料才多少年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5330">88:50</a> “先把女生的故事说好”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5627">93:47</a> 看到了“老登”外的“不登，就是一种进步，创造我们新的规则</span></p><span></span><p><span>彩蛋1：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5309">88:29</a> 什么问题归根结底不是阶级问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日夜校学员：</span></p><span></span><p><span>荒荒</span></p><span></span><p><span>穿普拉达的南瓜</span></p><span></span><p><span>Major Tom</span></p><span></span><p><span>ziggy</span></p><span></span><p><span>小林</span></p><span></span><p><span>谈话中所提及到的电影：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《穿普拉达的女王》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《太阳照常升起》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《牯岭街少年杀人事件》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《大红灯笼高高挂》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《奥本海默》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《西西里的美丽传说》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《风月奇谭》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《我就这样过了一生》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《芭比》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《好东西》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《粉色的火烈鸟》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《惊声尖笑》《惊声尖叫》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《月光光心慌慌系列》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《我唾弃你的坟墓》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《城市之光》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《枯叶》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《阴风阵阵》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《刺心》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《八部半》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《阿玛柯德》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《小姐》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《亲切的金子》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《蒂凡尼的早餐》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《机器人总动员》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll4rkr8f8RLNnhlH4C6oCQmVV_UD.m4a" length="91763610" type="audio/mp4"/>
